# AgitWarriorFlee (35429, Oel Mahum Scouts), AgitThief (35432) and AgitWizardFlee (35431), all
# walking. A fixture monster has 440 hit points; the attacked hooks read the hit points from
# before the hit. Each notices the character on the first AI tick: attack by 200, which the hits
# add to. Above half its hit points a hit adds its weight (100 per twentieth) cut to a whole
# number, so the scout's first hit of 23 makes 200 + int(104.5...) = 304; above 30% it does so on
# a draw under 90 (0) and else (95) breaks off: it drops every attack desire and, 5 s on, timer
# 3001 makes it fight again; at 30% or less it breaks off for good. Broken off, a hit makes it
# want to flee the character by its drift range (200), weight 10000; the thief also drops its
# attack desires and wants its hold (4047) on a draw under 10, the cleric its heal (4065) on
# itself. The second scout, broken off above 30%, fights again once timer 3001 fires.
character Hunter 20
random 0 95 0 95 0 95 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.AgitWarrior.AgitWarriorFlee.AgitThief
script script.ai.individual.AgitWarrior.AgitWarriorFlee.AgitWarriorFlee
script script.ai.individual.AgitWarrior.AgitWarriorFlee.AgitWizardFlee
npc scout 35429 Monster 100 0 0 walks
npc thief 35432 Monster -100 0 0 walks skill DD_MAGIC 4047 6
npc cleric 35431 Monster 0 100 0 walks skill DD_MAGIC 4065 6
npc scout2 35429 Monster 0 -100 0 walks

tick
  desires scout attack(player)=200
  desires thief attack(player)=200
  desires cleric attack(player)=200
  desires scout2 attack(player)=200

hit scout 23
  desires scout attack(player)=304

hit scout 220
  desires scout attack(player)=1304

hit scout 22
  desires scout attack(player)=1404

hit scout 22
  desires scout -

hit scout 50
  desires scout flee(player,200)=10000

hit thief 110
  desires thief attack(player)=700

hit thief 220
  desires thief attack(player)=1700

hit thief 22
  desires thief -

hit thief 22
  desires thief flee(player,200)=10000 cast(player,4047,move)=1000000

hit cleric 300
  desires cleric attack(player)=1563

hit cleric 22
  desires cleric -

hit cleric 22
  desires cleric flee(player,200)=10000 cast(cleric,4065,move)=1000000

hit scout2 230
  desires scout2 attack(player)=1245

hit scout2 22
  desires scout2 -

advance 5s

hit scout2 22
  desires scout2 attack(player)=100
